---
// src/pages/status.astro
// Fully standalone page - matches Dayront brand colors
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>System Status | Dayront</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Dayront system status. Learn about our 100% client-side architecture and reliability." />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-wrapper">
    <main class="status-card">
      
      <!-- Brand Header -->
      <div class="brand-header">
        <div class="brand-logo">
          <!-- Simple SVG placeholder for Dayront logo -->
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect width="24" height="24" rx="6" fill="#0ea5e9"/>
            <path d="M12 8V16M8 12H16" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Dayront</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Header -->
      <header class="header">
        <h1>System Status</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Last updated: Always real-time</p>
      </header>

      <!-- Main Status Indicator -->
      <div class="status-indicator">
        <span class="pulse-container">
          <span class="pulse-ring"></span>
          <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="status-text">All Systems Operational</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Explanation -->
      <section class="explanation">
        <h2>Architecture Overview</h2>
        <p>
          Dayront is a <strong>100% client-side application</strong>. We use WebAssembly (FFmpeg) to process your audio and video files entirely within your browser.
        </p>
        <p>
          This means <strong>there are no backend servers</strong> processing your media. There is no server-side downtime, no queue times, and your files never leave your device.
        </p>

        <h2>External Dependencies</h2>
        <p>
          The only external service we rely on is Vercel's static Edge Network to serve the application files and the FFmpeg engine. You can view their live status below:
        </p>
        <a href="https://www.vercel-status.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link">
          View Vercel Status Page →
        </a>
      </section>

    </main>
  </div>
</body>

<style>
  /* Dayront Brand Variables */
  :root {
    --brand-blue: #0ea5e9;
    --brand-blue-hover: #0284c7;
    --brand-bg: #f0f9ff;
    --brand-text-dark: #0f172a;
    --brand-text-body: #475569;
    --brand-border: #e2e8f0;
    --brand-success-bg: #f0fdf4;
    --brand-success-text: #166534;
    --brand-success-dot: #22c55e;
  }

  .page-wrapper {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background-color: var(--brand-bg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  }

  .status-card {
    background: white;
    max-width: 520px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.08), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--brand-border);
  }

  .brand-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .brand-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--brand-text-dark);
  }

  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .header h1 {
    font-size: 1.875rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand-text-dark);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--brand-text-body);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .status-indicator {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    background-color: var(--brand-success-bg);
    border: 1px solid #dcfce7;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .pulse-container {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    height: 12px;
    width: 12px;
  }

  .pulse-ring {
    position: absolute;
    display: inline-flex;
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--brand-success-dot);
    opacity: 0.75;
    animation: ping 1.5s cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1) infinite;
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    border-radius: 50%;
    height: 12px;
    width: 12px;
    background-color: var(--brand-success-dot);
  }

  @keyframes ping {
    75%, 100% {
      transform: scale(2.5);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  .status-text {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--brand-success-text);
  }

  .explanation h2 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-text-dark);
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .explanation p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--brand-text-body);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--brand-blue);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .link:hover {
    color: var(--brand-blue-hover);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
